The MIT license above covers the code in this repository (the website in
docs/*.html and the scripts in pipeline/).

The data files in docs/ (counts.json, idx.json, w8.json, wover.json,
pos.json, groups.json, hero.json, badge.json) are derived from the FlyWire
whole-brain connectome of Drosophila melanogaster, which is released under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).
If you reuse them, keep this attribution:

  Dorkenwald, S. et al. Neuronal wiring diagram of an adult brain.
  Nature 634, 124-138 (2024). https://flywire.ai
  Schlegel, P. et al. Whole-brain annotation and multi-connectome cell
  typing of Drosophila. Nature 634, 139-152 (2024).

The neuron model and its parameters follow Shiu, P. K. et al. A Drosophila
computational brain model reveals sensorimotor processing. Nature 634,
210-219 (2024), code released under the MIT license at
https://github.com/philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model
